Subject: [PATCH] Undead paladins train at the priest trainers

The app's undead paladins (mod-allied-races, on the realm whose
AlliedRaces.Enable is on) find a paladin trainer in every priest class
trainer: ObjectMgr::GetTrainer(creature, player) gives them the paladin
class trainer whose spells suit them most (the Horde's), in the gossip's
trainer option, the trainer list, buying a spell, resetting talents and
seeing the trainer.
